          "justification": "The idea's core claim is that 'PairSmell instances influence each other through the dependency graph' and can be studied via a 'smell contagion model... bridging software engineering and network science.' None of the closest Solution Space entries frame architectural smell occurrence as network propagation; R11 predicts decay, R34 models change propagation, and R62 compares modular structure to co-change. This is a non-obvious cross-domain import of network contagion into architectural smell analysis.",
