          "differentiation": "Prior solution-space work forecasts decay from history (R11), locates compound debt and predicts cost trajectories (R14), measures change ripple effects (R34), or detects modularity violations by comparing expected and actual co-change (R62). This idea instead models interdependence among PairSmell instances themselves: whether a smell on one structural edge increases the probability of smells on adjacent edges, with InSep/InCol asymmetry."
